Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 11:46:59 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] feat(example): add an Office-style start page

Replace the default page of the example app with a start screen:
navigation rail (Home, New, Open, Document, Spreadsheet, Presentation,
PDF form), "Start new" tiles (blank files and templates), and a recent
list with type filters, search, open, download and delete.

Everything goes through the example's existing routes (/editor,
/upload, /convert, /download, DELETE /file); the new router only adds
/elixir/api/files and /elixir/new?template=<id>. Logo, favicon and
templates are distribution assets read from public/elixir/brand/ and
are optional. The test harness stays at /?dev=1, linked from the
Developer item of the rail. No framework, no web font.

[branding]

Assisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-5-5
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
